# Guard: a worker with a bow from the Armory (StructureSystem::tickCarriers moves it and shoots for it: no physics
# body, no unit sim, and nothing can hurt it). Global: the game writes its position. Spawned with its feet on the road.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales): a dark red tunic (the root), a head, a helmet, and the BOW it holds in FRONT
# of its body (-Z: an entity's forward is -Z).
# CullMode RootOnly: the root culls for all its pieces. Mover: the game moves it, so it is no shelter for the snow.
Prefab gameGuard
	Global true
	Mover true
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar2
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.55 0.14 0.12
		Position 0 0.5 0
		Scale 0.22
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Head
			Position 0 1.1 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Sphere
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.85 0.68 0.5
				Scale 0.17
		Entity
			Name Helmet
			Position 0 1.24 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.55 0.55 0.6
				Scale 0.2
		# The bow: two Pillar3 pieces (0.42 m each at scale 0.07) stacked from 0.33 to 1.17 m.
		Entity
			Name Bow1
			Position 0.12 0.54 -0.32
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node Pillar3
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.24 0.12
				Scale 0.07
		Entity
			Name Bow2
			Position 0.12 0.96 -0.32
